# $MCP_SECRETS_DIR/gateway.env (mode 600). Managed by `./mcp token <name>` / `./mcp add` / `./mcp remove`.
# One 64-char hex token per server: <NAME>_UPSTREAM_TOKEN (name upper-cased, '-' -> '_').
# The same value goes into the portal's server entry as a Custom Header:
#   {"Authorization": "Bearer <token>"}
GMX_UPSTREAM_TOKEN=
